finding-amd-power-profile-advice = VR load comes in short bursts an the default profile lats the clocks drap atween them, sae some frames miss the heidset deidline. SteamVR switches tae the VR profile itsel, WiVRn an Monado dinnae. Till reboot: echo { $profile } | sudo tee { $file }, or set it for guid in LACT or CoreCtrl.
finding-amd-power-profile-title = The AMD GPU isnae in its VR pouer profile
finding-compositor-not-realtime-advice = Whan the CPU is thrang the compositor misses its deidline an the heidset rate hauves (90 tae 45 or laicher) for a while. Gie it aince, then restairt it: sudo setcap CAP_SYS_NICE=+ep { $path }. A package update taks it awa.
finding-compositor-not-realtime-title = { $compositor } cannae rin its compositor at realtime priority
finding-desktop-entry-missing-advice = A sort maks it again.
finding-desktop-entry-missing-title = The stairt-menu entry is missin
finding-dips-advice = Neither the GPU load nor its clock explains them, or MangoHud didnae report them. They maistly come fae loadin on the gemme's main threid: warlds, avatars jynin, videos.
finding-dips-gpu-bound-advice = Lowse the resolution in WiVRn or the in-gemme graphics settins, or hide avatars faur awa.
finding-dips-gpu-bound-title = The GPU is stappit fu durin the slowdouns
finding-dips-gpu-clock-advice = Pouer management lowers the clock juist whan frames need it. Uise the VR pouer profile (see abuin) or a fixed performance level.
finding-dips-gpu-clock-title = The GPU clock draps durin the slowdouns
finding-dips-gpu-waiting-advice = Frames are late wioot the GPU bein thrang: the gemme's main threid, the compositor or loadin (avatars, warlds, video) hauds them back. Check the findins abuin first; a scene wi mony avatars on a 6-core CPU is the usual limit.
finding-dips-gpu-waiting-title = The GPU sits idle durin the slowdouns
finding-dips-title = Slowdouns in the last session
finding-flatpak-advice = Proton's container cannae stairt fae inside Flatpak wioot host access. Uise the AppImage or the native package.
finding-flatpak-title = Unilux is rinnin inside a Flatpak sandbox
finding-freezes-advice = Irregular freezes maistly line up wi loadin: warlds, avatars jynin, videos.
finding-freezes-periodic-advice = Freezes on a fixed clock come fae a timer inside the gemme (a regular redd-up, a poll, a network or voice job), no fae the GPU or the compositor. Mind whit ye were daein an compare wi voice chat or the microphone aff.
finding-freezes-periodic-title = The gemme freezes ilka { $period } s
finding-freezes-title = Freezes in the last session
finding-game-running-title = Somnium Space is rinnin ({ $count } processes)
finding-github-unreachable-advice = Installs an sorts doonload fae GitHub. Check yer connection, proxy or firewall.
finding-github-unreachable-title = GitHub cannae be reached
finding-immutable-distro-advice = Unilux writes anely tae yer hame directory, sae this shuid wirk. Reports are walcome either wey.
finding-immutable-distro-title = { $distro } is an immutable distribution
finding-log-certificate-advice = The patched libraries are likely no in uise. Rin a sort.
finding-log-certificate-title = Certificate errors in the launch log
finding-log-container-advice = Leuk at the line in the evidence; it aften names a missin path or permission.
