finding-log-openxr-advice = Connect the heidset afore launchin an check the runtime sees it.
finding-log-openxr-title = The gemme couldnae reach the OpenXR runtime
finding-log-tls-advice = The patched secur32/crypt32 are likely no in uise. Rin a sort.
