finding-swap-disk-advice = Pages the gemme touches again come back fae disk, an the frame waits on them: freezes whan loadin warlds an avatars. Set up zram (zram-generator or yer distribution's zram package) sae swappit pages bide in compressed RAM, an shut brousers or ither heavy apps afore playin.
finding-swap-disk-title = The last session shoved { $gb } GB tae swap
finding-swap-zram-advice = zram keeps swap cheap, but the kernel aye pit oot gemme memory. Shut ither heavy apps afore playin; wi zram, vm.swappiness atween 100 an 180 swaps idle pages afore the gemme's.
