finding-video-domain-blocked-advice = Somnium anely plays links fae domains on its ain allou list; the player bides blank wioot an error. This is the gemme's rule, no Wine's: uise a YouTube link or a host the warld's makar allous.
finding-video-domain-blocked-title = Somnium refused some video links
finding-video-extract-failed-advice = yt-dlp ran but couldnae read thir links: private or age-restrictit videos, or YouTube chynged something. Try anither video; gin ilka ane fails, Somnium needs a yt-dlp update.
