finding-xr-overlay-advice = It's a seicont client o the compositor an taks focus fae the gemme whan shawn. Gin slowdouns line up wi it, shut it tae compare.
finding-xr-overlay-title = XR owerlay rinnin: { $overlays }
finding-ytdlp-blocked-advice = Somnium's yt-dlp.exe checks the name o its temporary directory, an stock Wine shortens it, sae nae YouTube video loads. Uise a recipe wi the pyinstaller-tempnam sort (the biggit-in recommendit ane has it): unilux recipe use recommended.
